"""Idea Foundry: a local idea-to-app workbench."""

__version__ = "0.36.0"

__release_notes__ = "Planning coherence: browser apps with real APIs now require API contracts and early backend checkpoints. Evidence-ready proposals reject contradictory task endpoints, exact repeated work, missing declared server-restart scenarios, conflicting fixture IDs, missing UI declarations and unsupported ordering claims. Feature task packets include their actual acceptance contract and disclose exclusion of rejected previous proposals. Existing unapproved proposals are re-reviewed for display and approval; approved plans/source are kept. Test adds eight fixed adversarial planning checks and a read-only selected-proposal audit without inference. Diag includes current-versus-stored review, duplicate groups, restart indexes, latest-run stage timing and retained acceptance counts, without prompts/source/sample values. Full review, human approval, execution/cloud consent, frozen checks and bounded attempts remain required. These guards catch defined contradictions; they do not prove arbitrary semantics or live model quality."
